
✅ 5. sleep() vs wait()

| Feature       | `sleep()` | `wait()`             |
| ------------- | --------- | -------------------- |
| Class         | Thread    | Object               |
| Releases Lock | ❌ No     | ✅ Yes               |
| Static        | ✅ Yes    | ❌ No                |
| Used For      | Delay     | Thread communication |